  {
    "key": "ui_f91cd10a7e",
    "source": "句意搜索使用本地 BGE 模型，各经典独立检索；可与日常表达、原文搜索同时启用。儒释道结合原文与单独编写的现代检索提示，展示文言原文。拉丁文按所附分节映射关联中文圣经；无对应的部分仍可阅读和搜索原文。结果辅助查找，请结合上下文理解。",
    "en": "Meaning search uses a local Chinese BGE model and a separate index for each text. Expressions and Original text can run alongside it. Classical texts include separate modern Chinese search aids. Latin results use the bundled verse mapping; unmapped passages remain readable and searchable by original wording. Read the context to understand a result."
  },
